WEBVTT

00:10:59.279 --> 00:11:01.036
We have human creativity.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:04.713
We paint our grief, dance our grief,

00:11:04.737 --> 00:11:06.538
write our grief.

00:11:06.562 --> 00:11:09.435
We also can grieve for people
we've never met,

00:11:09.459 --> 00:11:11.506
across space and time.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.191
I felt this strongly when I went to Berlin

00:11:14.215 --> 00:11:16.741
and I stood at the Holocaust Memorial.

00:11:17.428 --> 00:11:19.740
Animals don't grieve exactly like we do,

00:11:19.764 --> 00:11:22.516
but this doesn't mean
that their grief isn't real.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:25.657
It is real, and it's searing,

00:11:25.681 --> 00:11:28.082
and we can see it if we choose.

00:11:29.495 --> 00:11:31.911
Now, I've lost both my parents.